 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY11-25 OCF $68.5B less capex $57.9B left only **$10.6B FCF**. Buybacks **$11.6B (109%)**; dividends **$10.7B (101%)**; payout **210%**, funded by asset sales and debt. Since the 2021 WPX merger: FCF $17.6B, payout **71%**.",
    "zh": "FY11-25 OCF $68.5B 减资本开支 $57.9B，仅得 **FCF $10.6B**。回购 **$11.6B（109%）**；股息 **$10.7B（101%）**；分配率 **210%**，差额靠出售资产和举债。2021 年合并 WPX 以来：FCF $17.6B，分配率 **71%**。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Diluted shares FY11 414M to FY25 633M, **up 53%** (2016 equity raise, 2021 all-stock WPX). Coterra added ~532M in May 2026, so ~1.14B today. The $8B buyback is **~16%** of the $50.5B market cap.",
    "zh": "稀释股数由 FY11 的 414M 增至 FY25 的 633M，**增加 53%**（2016 年增发、2021 年全股票合并 WPX）。2026年5月合并 Coterra 新增约 5.32 亿股，目前约 11.4 亿股。$80 亿回购授权约为 $505 亿市值的 **16%**。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Value it on price and cost, not growth.",
    "zh": "按价格和成本估值，不按增长。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "FY25 revenue rose 7.8% to $17.19B while net income fell 8.9% as WTI dropped from $75.79 to $64.87. Even so, OCF was $6.71B. The model is price × volume - unit cost - capex. FY15 shows the other side: impairments drove a $12.9B loss.",
    "zh": "FY25 营收增长 7.8% 至 $17.19B，但 WTI 由 $75.79 跌至 $64.87，净利润下降 8.9%。即便如此，OCF 仍有 $6.71B。模型按「价格 × 产量 - 单位成本 - 资本开支」搭建。FY15 则是反面：减值导致 $129 亿亏损。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The merger doubles the base; per share is the test.",
    "zh": "合并让体量翻倍，检验在每股。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Coterra (closed May 7) lifts output from ~0.84 to ~1.6M Boe/d but adds ~532M shares. Value per share rises only if the $1B synergies and buybacks outrun that dilution. Over FY11-25 shares already rose 53%.",
    "zh": "Coterra（5月7日完成）把产量从约 84 万提升到约 160 万桶油当量/天，但新增约 5.32 亿股。只有 $10 亿协同和回购跑赢稀释，每股价值才会提升。FY11-25 股数已增加 53%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Asset sales should close the discount.",
    "zh": "出售资产应能收窄折价。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Eagle Ford sold for $4.2B, about 40% above proved value, while DVN trades ~4.8x 2027E EV/EBITDA, a turn below peers. Activists (Toms, Kimmeridge) push for more. Selling is not free: our base deck puts the lost cash flow at about -$3/share.",
    "zh": "Eagle Ford 以 $42 亿出售，约比探明储量价值高 40%；而 DVN 按 2027E 只有约 4.8x EV/EBITDA，比同行低约一倍。激进投资者（Toms、Kimmeridge）在推动更多出售。但出售不是免费的：按基准价格，失去的现金流约合每股 -$3。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Cash returns are large for the size.",
    "zh": "相对市值，现金回报很大。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Devon returns ~70% of FCF, raised the dividend 33% to $0.32 a quarter and has an $8B buyback. Base 2027E FCF ~$6.7B is a ~13% yield at $50.5B. Watch shares below 1,150M. $1.25B of 2026 debt repayment targets net debt below 1x EBITDA by end-2027.",
    "zh": "公司约 70% 的 FCF 回馈股东，季度股息上调 33% 至 $0.32，并有 $80 亿回购授权。基准 2027E FCF 约 $67 亿，按 $505 亿市值约 13% 收益率。关注股数是否降到 11.5 亿以下。2026 年偿债 $12.5 亿，目标是 2027 年底净债务/EBITDA 低于 1 倍。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Low cost limits the downside.",
    "zh": "低成本限制了下行空间。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Breakeven is just under $44 WTI. On Morningstar's $60 deck our model gives $52.83. Oil fell ~7% on Nov 2 on Iran talks and the stock is $44.27, below that conservative anchor. Q3 EPS of $1.42 beat the $1.31 consensus (Nov 5).",
    "zh": "盈亏平衡在 $44 WTI 以下。用 Morningstar 的 $60 价格，我们的模型得出 $52.83。11月2日因美伊和谈油价跌约 7%，股价已到 $44.27，低于这一保守锚点。Q3 EPS $1.42，高于 $1.31 的一致预期（11月5日）。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The DCF needs volume held, not high oil.",
    "zh": "DCF 要的是守住产量，而不是高油价。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $69.33 (8.31% WACC, 1.5% g) needs WTI $79 in 2027 fading to $70 and ~$5.5B capex holding ~1.6M Boe/d. At $44.27 that is +56.6%. I sit 11.8% above Morningstar ($62), mostly on the price deck. Failure test: WTI below $60 for a quarter, or 2027 capex above $6B for flat output.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $69.33（WACC 8.31%，g 1.5%）要求 2027 年 WTI $79、之后回落到 $70，且约 $55 亿资本开支能维持约 160 万桶油当量/天。按 $44.27 计，空间 +56.6%。我比 Morningstar（$62）高 11.8%，主要来自油价假设。失效信号：WTI 连续一个季度低于 $60，或 2027 年资本开支超过 $60 亿而产量持平。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "footnotes": {
